flowchart TD
    A[CLI: post / range / migrate] --> B[Pipeline]
    B --> C[Danbooru API<br/>post json]
    C --> D[source_posts]
    B --> E[Prompt Builder<br/>prompt + schema + fingerprint]
    E --> F{caption_cache<br/>fingerprint hit?}
    B --> G[caption_jobs]
    F -->|yes| H[caption_results<br/>upsert latest result]
    F -->|no| I[ditto-core runtime frontdoor<br/>build_language_model -> L0 LanguageModel]
    I --> J[OpenAI Responses API<br/>input_text + input_image URL]
    J --> K[OpenAI prompt cache<br/>prompt_cache_key]
    J --> M[Structured JSON output]
    M --> F
    M --> H
    H --> L[stdout / downstream reader]

